[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  \u001b[37mThe pod is Pending. There is nowhere to put it -- so Karpenter goes shopping.\u001b[39m\u001b[24X\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m[$_$] Karpenter\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mOne pod with nowhere to go. Buying a machine.\u001b[39m\u001b[38X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mWhile we wait. Those four numbers Timur read out -- this is what they do.\u001b[39m\u001b[10X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNobody asked.\u001b[39m\u001b[70X\u001b[6;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina's notes\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1m. A LIVENESS PROBE, IN FOUR NUMBERS\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m initialDelaySeconds   5   wait this long before the first question\u001b[33X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m periodSeconds         5   then ask again this often\u001b[48X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m timeoutSeconds        1   an answer slower than this is a miss\u001b[37X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m failureThreshold      3   this many misses in a row and the pod dies\u001b[31X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Patience = initialDelay + failureThreshold x period = 20 seconds.\u001b[34X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m The service needs 30. Nothing else here"]
