[0.000, "o", "m \u001b[37mIt holds because nothing changed. Not because the number is right.\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mA cold cache. A noisier neighbour on the node. A bigger dataset. One more step\u001b[39m     \r\n        \u001b[37mat boot.\u001b[39m\u001b[87X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNone of those touch the manifest, and every one of them moves the start.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery other number in a probe reacts to something the process did. This one only\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37mcounts.\u001b[39m\u001b[88X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt cannot tell a slow start from a dead process, because it is not looking.\u001b[39m        \r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m+ pod up (2s)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[88X\u001b[29;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl -n demo get pods -l app=svc\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[64X\r\n  NAME\u001b[19X\u001b[19CREADY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\u001b[46X\r\n  svc-554489b748-kgkwk   1/1     Running   0\u001b[10X\u001b[10C42s\u001b[46X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mGreen. Told you.\u001b[39m\u001b[67X\u001b[34;103H\u001b[1K\r"]
