[0.000, "o", "er dataset. One more step\u001b[39m     \r\n        \u001b[37mat boot.\u001b[39m\u001b[87X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNone of those touch the manifest, and every one of them moves the start.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery other number in a probe reacts to something the process did. This one only\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37mcounts.\u001b[39m\u001b[88X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt cannot tell a slow start from a dead process, because it is not looking.\u001b[39m        \r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m+ pod up (2s)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[88X\u001b[24;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl -n demo get pods -l app=svc\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[64X\r\n  NAME\u001b[19X\u001b[19CREADY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\u001b[46X\r\n  svc-554489b748-kgkwk   1/1     Running   0\u001b[10X\u001b[10C42s\u001b[46X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mGreen. Told you.\u001b[39m\u001b[67X\u001b[29;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mA week passes. The cache is cold, Karpenter has packed two more containers onto the node, and CPU\u001b(B\u001b[m    \r\n  \u001b[1mis now shared. The service starts in 50 seconds, not 15.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[45"]
[0.000, "o", "X\u001b[32;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl -n demo set env deploy/svc WARMUP_SECONDS=50\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47X\r\n  deployment.apps/svc env updated\u001b[70X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mI did not touch the manifest.\u001b[39m\u001b[54X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe manifest did not change. Everything around it got slower.\u001b[39m\u001b[22X\r\n  \u001b[37m[o_o] kubelet\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwenty-five seconds gone. Asking: are you alive?\u001b[39m\u001b[35X\u001b[38;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mTwo numbers are racing. Patience runs out at forty seconds. The service is ready at fifty.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\u001b[40;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2msame manifest, slower environment\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[68X\r\n  \u001b[2mready \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . restarts \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . 55s . [->] click to move on\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39X\r\n  svc-7fc46f7645-rrfrs\u001b[11X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\u001b[11C1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
