[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m liveness    is the process alive?      -> restart the container\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m readiness   can it serve right now?    -> out of the load balancer\u001b[33X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m While startup runs, the other two are not consulted at all.\u001b[40X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Its budget is its own: failureThreshold x period = 60 x 2 = 120s.\u001b[34X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Once it passes it is never consulted again.\u001b[56X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m So boot gets a deadline, and liveness goes back to asking about\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m steady state, which is what it was for.\u001b[60X\u001b[31;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2msame slow start, RESTARTS still 0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[68X\r\n  \u001b[2mready \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . restarts \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . 6s . [->] click to move on\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[40X\r\n  svc-7fcc45ff49-vk9cm\u001b[11X\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\u001b[11C0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[37m[o_o] kubelet\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mI was told to wait, so I waited. Nobody told me before.\u001b[39m\u001b[28X\u001b[37;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n================"]
