[0.000, "o", "======================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[35;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mStart is fixed. Rolling out the production configuration.\u001b[39m\u001b[26X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThree replicas, 10-second warmup, /work doing a real query against RDS.\u001b[39m\u001b[12X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTouching liveness?\u001b[39m\u001b[65X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mWhy? It is green.\u001b[39m\u001b[66X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt goes to the database through the same pool as /work.\u001b[39m\u001b[28X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mPool of four, the query is trivial. Ship it.\u001b[39m\u001b[39X\u001b[42;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mwhat changes: 12-startup-probe.yaml -> 13-under-load.yaml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[44X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l  \u001b[2m[->]\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mclick to see the diff\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m. [s] skip . [q] quit\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
