[0.000, "o", "31m-# HEALTHZ_MODE=local: liveness answers \"is this process alive\" without leaving\u001b[39m\u001b[22X\r\n  \u001b[31m-# the process. It cannot be starved by the work the process is doing.\u001b[39m\u001b[31X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# \"Readiness should verify we can actually read our data.\" Nobody argues with\u001b[39m\u001b[23X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# that in a pull request, and at three replicas nobody notices: a scan every two\u001b[39m\u001b[20X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# seconds, three times over, is a rounding error on the database.\u001b[39m\u001b[35X\r\n   #\u001b[99X\r\n  \u001b[31m-# And the numbers get slack: 10-second period, 3-second timeout, five misses.\u001b[39m\u001b[23X\r\n  \u001b[31m-# A liveness probe should be the last resort, not the first responder -- taking\u001b[39m\u001b[21X\r\n  \u001b[31m-# a busy replica out of the load balancer is readiness' job, and readiness stays\u001b[39m\u001b[20X\r\n  \u001b[31m-# tight on purpose.\u001b[39m\u001b[81X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# The cost is replicas x (1/period). That is the entire incident. Everything that\u001b[39m\u001b[19X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# follows is arithmetic.\u001b[39m\u001b[76X\r\n  \u001b[32m+#\u001b[39m\u001b[99X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# The worker is scaled by KEDA on queue"]
[0.000, "o", " depth, from zero. Its pool is four\u001b[39m\u001b[26X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# connections per replica. The database has 60, of which RDS keeps 4 for itself\u001b[39m\u001b[21X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# and 2 more are held back for the observer -- 54 are actually available.\u001b[39m\u001b[27X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# maxReplicaCount is 24 here, so the ceiling is 24x4 = 96 worker connections\u001b[39m\u001b[24X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# plus 3x4 from the api against a budget of 54. The wall is not a risk, it is\u001b[39m\u001b[23X\r\n  \u001b[32m+# a schedule.\u001b[39m\u001b[87X\r\n   apiVersion: apps/v1\u001b[81X\r\n   kind: Deployment\u001b[84X\r\n  \u001b[36m@@ -43,5 +49,7 @@\u001b[39m spec:\u001b[78X\u001b[38;17H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cvalue: \"local\"\u001b[72X\u001b[39;15H\u001b[1K\u001b[C- name: READY_MODE\u001b[70X\r\n  \u001b[31m-\u001b[14X\u001b[14Cvalue: \"cached\"\u001b[39m\u001b[71X\r\n  \u001b[32m+\u001b[14X\u001b[14Cvalue: \"db_each_call\"\u001b[39m\u001b[65X\r\n  \u001b[32m+\u001b[12X\u001b[12C- name: QUEUE_URL\u001b[39m\u001b[71X\r\n  \u001b[32m+\u001b[14X\u001b[14Cvalue: ${QUEUE_URL}\u001b[39m\u001b[67X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[11G\u001b[?2026l\u001b[?2026h\u001b[4G\u001b[?2026l\r"]
