[0.000, "o", "======\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n  2.4 . Madina unhooks the probe\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[71X\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n====================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[34;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n  THE ANSWER: none of the three.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[71X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[39;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mAll three add work to the database, and the database is where everyone is already stuck. The first\u001b[39m   \r\n  \u001b[37mone also buys more machines.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[42;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mUnhook the probe from the database.\u001b[39m\u001b[48X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
