[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\u001b[2d  Scaling did not save the service. Scaling is what took it down -- and it bought hardware to do it.\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[31m\u001b[1m\r\n====================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[4;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[33m\u001b[1m\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[33m\u001b[1m\r\n  EVERYONE VOTE: what do you do first?\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65X\u001b[33m\u001b[1m\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m   \r\n  \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m . raise maxReplicaCount -- there are clearly not enough workers\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[1m2\u001b(B\u001b[m . restart the database -- it is slow\u001b[63X\r\n  \u001b[1m3\u001b(B\u001b[m . raise timeoutSeconds on the probe -- let it wait\u001b[49X\u001b[12;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1m-> step 2.4: Madina unhooks the probe\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[64X\u001b[15;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n====================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n  2.4 . Madina unhook"]
[0.000, "o", "s the probe\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[71X\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n====================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[19;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n  THE ANSWER: none of the three.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[71X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[24;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mAll three add work to the database, and the database is where everyone is already stuck. The first\u001b[39m   \r\n  \u001b[37mone also buys more machines.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[27;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mUnhook the probe from the database.\u001b[39m\u001b[48X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mA background goroutine does SELECT 1 every two seconds with a timeout and stores\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37mthe result in a flag.\u001b[39m\u001b[74X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe probe reads the flag. That is all.\u001b[39m\u001b[45"]
[0.000, "o", "X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd if the database really does go down?\u001b[39m\u001b[43X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe flag goes stale and the pod honestly leaves the load balancer.\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAll sixteen at once?\u001b[39m\u001b[63X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mOne at a time, as each flag expires. And the database gets not one extra query.\u001b[39m    \u001b[36;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mThe probe now costs O(1). Sixteen replicas or a hundred and sixty, it is the same.\u001b[39m\u001b[19X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwo more things. The pool is budgeted against the wall: three connections, not\u001b[39m     \r\n        \u001b[37mfour.\u001b[39m\u001b[90X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd KEDA gets a ceiling. An autoscaler without one is a way to turn an incident\u001b[39m    \r\n        \u001b[37minto an invoice.\u001b[39m\u001b[79X\u001b[42;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mwhat changes: 20-ready-db-each-call.yaml -> 21-ready-cached.yaml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37X\u001b[44;103H\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l  \u001b[2m[->]\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mclick to see the diff\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m. [s] skip . [q] quit\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.093, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[37;44r\u001b[38;105H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[37d\u001b[K  \u001b[2mno load running\u001b[1;44r\u001b[44;51H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.007, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;45m──\u001b[101C┬\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;238m──\u001b[2;104H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;45m│\u001b[3;104H│\u001b[4;104H│\u001b[5;104H│\u001b[6;104H│\u001b[7;104H│\u001b[8;104H│\u001b[9;104H│\u001b[10;104H│\u001b[11;104H│\u001b[12;104H│\u001b[13;104H│\u001b[14;104H│\u001b[15;104H│\u001b[16;104H│\u001b[17;104H│\u001b[18;104H│\u001b[19;104H│\u001b[20;104H│\u001b[21;104H│\u001b[22;104H│\u001b[23;104H│\u001b[24;104H│\u001b[25;104H│\u001b[26;104H│\u001b[27;104H│\u001b[28;104H│\u001b[29;104H│\u001b[30;104H├\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;238m──\u001b[31;104H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;45m│\u001b[32;104H│\u001b[33;104H│\u001b[34;104H│\u001b[35;104H│\u001b[36;104H├\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;238m──\u001b[37;104H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;45m│\u001b[38;104H│\u001b[39;104H│\u001b[40;104H│\u001b[41;104H│\u001b[42;104H│\u001b[43;104H│\u001b[44;104H│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;45m\u001b[1;3H LOAD ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;238m\u001b[3C PODS ─────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;238m\u001b[30;107H LOAD ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;238m\u001b[36;107H LOAD ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[1;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[44;51H\u001b[?2026l"]
