[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;1H  scaledobject.keda.sh/worker configured\u001b[63X\u001b[3;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina's notes\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1m. THE FIX, IN THREE PARTS\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[55X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m 1  The probe reads a flag, not the database. A goroutine refreshes\u001b[33X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    the flag on its own schedule, so the cost is O(1) in replicas\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    instead of O(n) -- and a stale flag still takes the pod out.\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m 2  The pool is budgeted against the wall: replicas x POOL_MAX has\u001b[34X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    to stay under max_connections, with room for everything else.\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m 3  maxReplicaCount is 12, not 24. An autoscaler without a ceiling\u001b[34X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    is a way to turn an incident into an invoice.\u001b[51X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Only the first one is about probes. The other two decide how far\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m the next mistake gets before something stops it.\u001b[51X\u001b[17;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mSame queue, same database, same cluster.\u001b("]
[0.000, "o", "B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\r\n  \u001b[1m> load: 20 rps, enqueue (panel bottom right)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[57X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwo things, while this runs. The workers column, and the node count.\u001b[39m\u001b[15X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery worker that comes up should go Ready and stay Ready. And the node count\u001b[39m      \r\n        \u001b[37mshould not move.\u001b[39m\u001b[79X\r\n  \u001b[37mThe queue will not go down -- two thousand a second go in, and twelve workers cannot outrun that.\u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[37mWatch the other two numbers.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[26;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mevery worker Ready, node count flat\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[66X\r\n  \u001b[2mqueue \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m55422/9\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . workers \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m6/15\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m ~$0.02/h . 90s . [->] click to move on\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[24X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-6s5rq         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-6w4px         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-bs9n8         \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10"]
[0.000, "o", "X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-bvjxv         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-kzzg5         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  ContainerCreating R:0\u001b[44X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-nq6x5         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-ps9q6         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-qxdq6         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7dc9f7b67d-2cwsh        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7dc9f7b67d-dz2x8        \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7dc9f7b67d-fkbh4        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7dc9f7b67d-gz9k9        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7dc9f7b67d-h4k7w        \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7dc9f7b67d-qzq6r        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7dc9f7b67d-rjvrt        \u001b[32"]
