[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Only the first one is about probes. The other two decide how far\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m the next mistake gets before something stops it.\u001b[51X\u001b[5;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mSame queue, same database, same cluster.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\r\n  \u001b[1m> load: 20 rps, enqueue (panel bottom right)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[57X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwo things, while this runs. The workers column, and the node count.\u001b[39m\u001b[15X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery worker that comes up should go Ready and stay Ready. And the node count\u001b[39m      \r\n        \u001b[37mshould not move.\u001b[39m\u001b[79X\r\n  \u001b[37mThe queue will not go down -- two thousand a second go in, and twelve workers cannot outrun that.\u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[37mWatch the other two numbers.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[14;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mevery worker Ready, node count flat\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[66X\r\n  \u001b[2mqueue \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m55422/9\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . workers \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m6/15\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m ~$0.02/h . 90s . [->] click to move on\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2"]
