[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  \u001b[1m> load: 20 rps, enqueue (panel bottom right)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[57X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwo things, while this runs. The workers column, and the node count.\u001b[39m\u001b[15X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery worker that comes up should go Ready and stay Ready. And the node count\u001b[39m      \r\n        \u001b[37mshould not move.\u001b[39m\u001b[79X\r\n  \u001b[37mThe queue will not go down -- two thousand a second go in, and twelve workers cannot outrun that.\u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[37mWatch the other two numbers.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[8;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mevery worker Ready, node count flat\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[66X\r\n  \u001b[2mqueue \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m55422/9\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . workers \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m6/15\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m ~$0.02/h . 90s . [->] click to move on\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[24X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-6s5rq         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-6w4px         \u001b[31m\u001b[1m0/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mPending\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-6c7455ddf-bs9n8         \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Runni"]
