[0.000, "o", "target.\u001b[39m\u001b[54X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mDifferent probe.\u001b[39m\u001b[67X\u001b[19;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwelve workers. Twelve Ready. A minute ago there were twenty-four and next to\u001b[39m      \r\n        \u001b[37mnone of them served.\u001b[39m\u001b[75X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mSo we are still behind.\u001b[39m\u001b[60X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mBehind, and working. Those twenty-four took messages and handed every one of\u001b[39m       \r\n        \u001b[37mthem back.\u001b[39m\u001b[85X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThese twelve finish what they take. One probe changed. Nothing else did.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m[$_$] Karpenter\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNothing is Pending. I have stopped buying.\u001b[39m\u001b[41X\r\n  \u001b[37mAnd nothing new was bought. Karpenter gives the idle machines back a couple of minutes later. It\u001b[39m     \r\n  \u001b[37mwas never the problem -- it did what it was asked.\u001b[39m\u001b[51X\u001b[29;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n========================="]
[0.000, "o", "===========================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n  readiness = can THIS pod serve, not is the shared database alive.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n====================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[33;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mPOSTMORTEM\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[91X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Incident       service down for 40 minutes\u001b[57X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Response       added replicas\u001b[70X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m What helped    nothing\u001b[77X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Also\u001b[11X\u001b[11C18 EC2 instances, bought during the outage\u001b[42X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Root cause     a probe asking about somebody else's health\u001b[41X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m At fault       Timur 0 . Ruslan 0 . kubelet 0\u001b[54X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Action item    Madina reviews the probes now\u001b[55X\u001b[43;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
