[0.000, "o", "===========================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[30;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mPOSTMORTEM\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[91X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Incident       service down for 40 minutes\u001b[57X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Response       added replicas\u001b[70X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m What helped    nothing\u001b[77X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Also\u001b[11X\u001b[11C18 EC2 instances, bought during the outage\u001b[42X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Root cause     a probe asking about somebody else's health\u001b[41X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m At fault       Timur 0 . Ruslan 0 . kubelet 0\u001b[54X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Action item    Madina reviews the probes now\u001b[55X\u001b[40;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37m\"Nobody at fault\" is not a real postmortem.\u001b[39m\u001b[40X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt is. The line that caused it was not written by anyone. It was copied.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mI wrote all of this down, by the way.\u001b[39m\u001b[46X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
