[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Root cause     a probe asking about somebody else's health\u001b[41X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m At fault       Timur 0 . Ruslan 0 . kubelet 0\u001b[54X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Action item    Madina reviews the probes now\u001b[55X\u001b[5;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37m\"Nobody at fault\" is not a real postmortem.\u001b[39m\u001b[40X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt is. The line that caused it was not written by anyone. It was copied.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mI wrote all of this down, by the way.\u001b[39m\u001b[46X\u001b[9;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n====================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n  Probes are the only code that can kill a healthy service -- and now bill you for it.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[17X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n====================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[13;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mTAKE THIS WITH YOU\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[83X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Everything you ju"]
